  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining OS Creation Layout**\n\nI\'m making excellent headway on defining the work order (OS) creation layout at `/src/components/OSManager.tsx`. Sprint 2 necessitates a visually rich UI to launch a new OS, and I\'m currently focused on how to best associate it with pre-registered clients and single items.\n\n\n**Implementing OS Creation Workflow**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the implementation details within `src/components/OSManager.tsx`. I\'m building an interactive wizard for client and device selection, followed by repair detail input. Upon successful submission to the `/api/ordens-servico` endpoint, which is validated through the Express backend, a beautiful, on-screen printable reception receipt is displayed. This includes all the vital information, and a print action for the operator.\n\n\n"
