  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Component**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the `BlingSandbox.tsx` component, the final piece of Sprint 4. The main requirement I\'m addressing is the automatic synchronization of data when an OS changes to \"FINALIZADO.\" I am working now to determine the necessary logic, state management, and external API interactions to achieve this specific functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing the Bling API**\n\nI\'ve made significant progress implementing the Bling API integration. I\'ve built real API requests, coupled with a robust simulated fallback mechanism that is fully traced. The tracing includes detailed handling of timeouts, with retry logic and an exponential backoff loop. I\'ve also implemented a circuit breaker for repeated failures, and I\'m handling SEFAZ rejections, displaying the relevant diagnostic logs, saving them to the OS index, and allowing user retries. I\'ve also simulated Sefaz processing steps and added an on-screen DANFE PDF viewer!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 40
      nanos: 77994407
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
