sabled:bg-slate-350\"\n          >\n            <Zap className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white\" />\n            <span>{isSyncing ? \"Processando...\" : \"Sincronizar OS no Bling\"}</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>"
