    modified_response: "I have successfully completed the comprehensive application of the **Professional Polish** design theme across all remaining components of your application!\n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n\n*   **Refinement of the Kanban Board (`KanbanBoard.tsx`)**:\n    *   **Unified Actions & Inputs**: Upgraded the parts launcher controls and secondary inputs with high-contrast corporate blue focus rings and modern rounded layouts (`rounded-lg`).\n    *   **Financial Total Card**: Transformed the static dark total box into an elegant slate-blue gradient component (`from-blue-600 to-indigo-650`) to provide instant visibility.\n    *   **Contextual Alerts & Success Feedback**: Restyled fiscal status reminders (Pronto p/ Retirada & Finalizado alerts) into clean status modules (`bg-blue-50` and `bg-emerald-50`) featuring crisp typography and icons.\n\n*   **Styling the Bling Integrations Panel (`BlingSandbox.tsx`)**:\n    *   **Corporate Controls**: Replaced obsolete helper highlights and radio states with corporate blue branding (`text-blue-650` and `focus:ring-blue-500`).\n    *   **Live Console Monitor**: Tweaked the real-time SEFAZ log monitor and SSL lock highlights to use professional glowing sky-blue text indicators (`text-sky-400`).\n    *   **Tabular Action Buttons**: Styled the *\"Abrir DANFE\"* and *\"Tentar Re-envio\"* actionable buttons in table records to feature custom rounded borders and tactile interactive hover indicators.\n    *   **DANFE Modal Header**: Aligned the popup printing tools and close layout with the new high-contrast corporate blue schema.\n\n*   **Global Layout Refinements**:\n    *   **Brand Customization**: Set the main application title in `index.html` to **\"MGV Tecnologia - Sistema de Gest\303\243o\"** to represent the assistencia\'s logo cleanly.\n    *   **Compilation & Quality**: Ran final validation lints and verified that the multi-module builds compile successfully for real-time operation."
